{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/475b3f225ff00736a04cba5432c7df49.poster.avif?t=1758376296\" width=610 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/475b3f225ff00736a04cba5432c7df49.webm?t=1758376296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/475b3f225ff00736a04cba5432c7df49.mp4?t=1758376296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Candy Bandits</strong> is a thrilling 3D top-down multiplayer party game where Guardians and Bandits face off in chaotic team battles! Equip a mix of passive and active abilities, collect powerful one-time actions from action boxes and strategize with your teammates to outsmart the competition. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal?</strong> Collect 30 candies to secure victory or stop the enemy team by catching them\u2014teamwork, quick thinking, and clever tactics are your keys to triumph!&quot;<br><br>Will you be a Guardian, defending the precious candies scattered across different landscapes, or will you embrace the life of a Bandit set on stealing these delicious treasures?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/d3a5cce9aa1a50917e463b0f05f3db03.poster.avif?t=1758376296\" width=610 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/d3a5cce9aa1a50917e463b0f05f3db03.webm?t=1758376296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/d3a5cce9aa1a50917e463b0f05f3db03.mp4?t=1758376296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Actions:</strong> Grab one of many action boxes scattered around the maps and use the unique effects to your and your teams advantage!<br>Actions vary from simple dashes to more complex team-based actions like laying bombs and blinding your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/f2b3b2827ec7e1342b4244a9e3f749ca.poster.avif?t=1758376296\" width=610 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/f2b3b2827ec7e1342b4244a9e3f749ca.webm?t=1758376296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/extras/f2b3b2827ec7e1342b4244a9e3f749ca.mp4?t=1758376296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maps:</strong> Explore a beautifully crafted world divided into distinct areas, each brought to life as a unique playable level. Navigate your choices with a specially designed, visually stunning map. Select your battleground, form your crew, and embark on epic candy heists. It's time to unite friends, break down genre boundaries, and embark on a thrilling adventure like no other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2670810?t=1758376296","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2670810?t=1758376296","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/95f94c2c9a639379acc9af570512dc166e5f6644/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758376296","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2670810/95f94c2c9a639379acc9af570512dc166e5f6644/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758376296","cate